============================================================================================
5.6 EXTENSION - LOGIT TRANSFORM ON BOUNDED [0,1] DVs
============================================================================================
Applied to the 7 DVs above that are bounded proportions (ctx_tokens_per_query is a token count and is excluded). logit(p) = ln(p/(1-p)), p clipped to [0.0001, 0.9999] before
transforming - recall_at_5 and legacy faithfulness both hit exactly 1.0
in this data, where raw logit is undefined. Raw-scale ANOVA and
assumption-check results above are kept as the primary report; this
extension only checks whether the transform fixes the normality/
homogeneity violations found in 5.2 (two-way) and EXTENSION 1 (three-way).

