2/14 (metric, model) combinations had normality restored by the logit transform.
Raw-scale results (5.2, and the two-way/three-way ANOVA tables above)
remain the primary report per the pre-registered spec; the logit-scale
tables above are kept as a sensitivity check wherever normality was
restored, and are otherwise informative but not decisive.

