Retrieval metrics = recall_at_5, mrr, ndcg_at_5.
Fidelity metrics = ragas_faithfulness, ragas_answer_relevance, factscore, selfcheck_consistency.
A large range + large eta-sq on one metric family but not the other,
for the same factor, is the stage-dissociation finding this table exists
to make legible in one place.

